      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.345,
      "end": 9.593,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这个稻子熟了，一般也就是平到这个胯骨这开啊，七八十公分高。",
      "score": 0.0176,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0089,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.038,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这个稻子熟了，一般也就是平到这个胯骨这口啊，七八十公分高。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 9.817,
      "end": 12.087,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "但是，随着现在科技的发展，",
      "score": 0.6031,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.2563,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.182,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "但是，车道现在科技的发展。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 12.129,
      "end": 18.287,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "农业专家们是培育出了优质水稻，高度比一般的这种水稻啊，",
      "score": 0.0183,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0008,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.04,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "农业专家们是培植出了优质水稻，高度比一般的这种水稻啊。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 18.287,
      "end": 29.051,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "哎，高度翻一番。前几天，我是首个巨型稻种植试点——临川县曹田乡巨型稻试验田开镰收获了。",
      "score": 0.3551,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2187,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.445,
        "seg_cer": 0.27,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "哎，高度翻一翻。前几天我是走过句行道种植试点，临川县曹田乡句行道试验田，开镰收割了。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 29.115,
      "end": 36.14,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "我们一起去现场去见识一下我们桂林培育出的巨型稻到底身高几何，",
      "score": 0.1465,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1129,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.191,
        "seg_cer": 0.103,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "我们一起去现场去见识一下，我们桂林配置出的巨型刀到底身高几何？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 36.14,
      "end": 42.622,
      "label": "uncertain",
      "text": "产量又是好多呢？该乡试点位于临川县曹田乡刘村，",
      "score": 0.4926,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2767,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.585,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.333,
        "phon_examples": "曹/朝",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "产量又是好多嘞！该乡试点位于临川县朝田乡六村。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 42.814,
      "end": 48.101,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "在该试验田里面，村民们抢抓晴好天气开镰收获，",
      "score": 0.0473,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.053,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.047,
        "seg_cer": 0.05,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "在该试验田里面，村民们抢抓晴好天气，开镰收割。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 48.101,
      "end": 57.384,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "确保颗粒归仓。该试点项目引进的巨型稻品种为巨型稻丰超五号和巨型稻丰超六号。",
      "score": 0.1731,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0247,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.257,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.222,
        "phon_examples": "超/草 超/草",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "确保可离轨仓。该试点项目引进的巨型道品种为巨型道丰草五号或巨型道丰草六号。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 57.623,
      "end": 60.253,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "该品种的巨型稻株型高大，",
